{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【新皇崗口岸10.12開通】</p><p>新皇崗口岸將於10月12日上午6時半正式開通，舊口岸會同時完成歷史任務。政府預料開通初期會較為繁忙，呼籲市民不用急於去體驗。有13條公共巴士或小巴路線，由不同地區往來口岸，巴士公司會提供轉乘優惠。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199932-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%886%E6%99%82%E5%8D%8A%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E9%84%A7%E7%82%B3%E5%BC%B7%E7%A8%B1%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E6%80%A5%E6%96%BC%E9%AB%94%E9%A9%97\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢合資格市民可「刷臉」過關</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199292-%E6%8A%95%E7%A5%A8%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E5%93%AA%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%E9%85%8D%E5%A5%97%E5%8D%B3%E7%9D%87%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A9%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%E5%85%A8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢即睇皇崗口岸自助通道全流程</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199889-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5%E7%9B%B4%E9%81%94%E6%B8%AF%E4%B9%9D%E6%96%B0%E7%95%8C%E5%90%84%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A%E8%BB%8A%E8%B2%BB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E9%80%9A%E5%AE%B5%E8%BB%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢交通攻略｜直達港九新界各路線車費、服務時間、通宵車</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199492-%E5%BE%9E%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E9%9B%BB%E5%8F%AC%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%AB%E5%83%85%E9%99%90%E9%A0%90%E7%B4%84%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%AB%E8%BB%8A%E9%9A%8A%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E7%B1%B2%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E6%80%A5%E6%96%BC%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B0%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%93%E9%99%84%E6%8A%95%E7%A5%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢電召的士僅限預約的士車隊</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199936-13%E6%A2%9D%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E6%88%96%E5%B0%8F%E5%B7%B4%E7%B7%9A%E5%BE%80%E4%BE%86%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E7%9A%87%E5%B7%B4%E5%B0%87%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E4%BB%BB%E5%8B%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢「皇巴」將完成歷史任務</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199860-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%B1%E9%97%9C%E5%8F%A3%E7%9B%B4%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E9%90%B5%E7%AB%99%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%94%E6%A2%9D%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E7%B7%9A%E9%80%A3%E6%8E%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢深圳方可由關口直落地鐵站</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1198921-%E9%80%BE%E5%8D%83%E5%90%8D%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E7%8D%B2%E9%82%80%E5%8F%83%E8%A7%80%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%93%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%9AWiFi%E6%9A%A2%E9%A0%86\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢市民參觀感受</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【啟德醫院投入服務】</p><p>啟德醫院10月5日起分階段投入服務，醫管局指整體運作暢順。不少病人都表示新醫院，設備完善、空間寬敞，但亦有部分人指，指示牌不夠清晰。新醫院啟用之際，意味伊利沙伯醫院即將完成歷史任務。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199065-%E9%86%AB%E7%AE%A1%E5%B1%80%E6%8C%87%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E9%A6%96%E6%97%A5%E6%95%B4%E9%AB%94%E9%81%8B%E4%BD%9C%E6%9A%A2%E9%A0%86%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E7%A8%B1%E6%8C%87%E7%A4%BA%E7%89%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%A0%E6%B8%85%E6%99%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢首日整體運作暢順</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199066-%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A216%E6%A2%9D%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E5%B0%8F%E5%B7%B4%E7%B7%9A%E4%BE%86%E5%BE%80%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E5%90%84%E5%8D%80%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E6%97%A5%E5%BE%8C%E6%9C%83%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%B0%88%E8%BB%8A%E7%9B%B4%E9%81%94\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢16條巴士小巴線來往九龍各區</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199121-%E7%9B%A7%E5%AF%B5%E8%8C%82%E4%B9%98%E6%B8%AF%E9%90%B5%E8%BD%89%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E8%A8%AA%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E9%A6%96%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8B%E4%BD%9C%E6%83%85%E6%B3%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢盧寵茂實地體驗公共交通配套</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199009-%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E6%8A%95%E5%85%A5%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E6%90%AD%E8%BB%8A%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5%E6%8E%A5%E9%A7%81%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E5%B0%8F%E5%B7%B4%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9B%A1%E8%A6%BD%E9%99%84%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E5%B0%8F%E8%B2%BC%E5%A3%AB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢搭車攻略｜接駁巴士、小巴路線一文盡覽｜附交通小貼士</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199239-%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E9%80%9A%E8%AD%98%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E6%B2%99%E4%BC%AF%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢時事通識｜伊利沙伯醫院</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【據悉政府就宏福苑火災按部門首長責任制啟動第二級調查】</p><p>消息指，政府已就大埔宏福苑火災，按部門首長責任制啟動第二級調查，並在公務員敘用委員會下設調查小組。公務員事務局局長楊何蓓茵指，若報告指明個別公務員存在失當，不排除直接展開紀律行動。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200125-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%93%9A%E6%82%89%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%B0%B1%E7%81%AB%E7%81%BD%E6%8C%89%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%95%B7%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E5%95%9F%E5%8B%95%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%B4%9A%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢楊何蓓茵：與敘用委員會秘書處商討人手及配套</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199206-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%93%9A%E6%82%89%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%95%9F%E5%8B%95%E5%85%AC%E5%8B%99%E5%93%A1%E6%95%98%E7%94%A8%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E6%9C%83%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB%E6%8C%89%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E6%9C%83%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E8%B7%9F%E9%80%B2%E5%95%8F%E8%B2%AC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢獨立委員會本月底前向特首交報告</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【安達臣道長實首置盤拆卸一半樓宇】</p><p>長實安達臣道首置項目，涉及有分判商貪污，令六幢大廈部分鋼筋嚴重偏離圖則，屋宇署接納其中三座的補救方案，發展商就計劃將其餘三幢拆卸重建。房屋局稱個別項目進度，不會對整體供應構成重大影響。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199767-%E9%95%B7%E5%AF%A6%E5%AE%89%E9%81%94%E8%87%A3%E9%81%93%E9%A6%96%E7%BD%AE%E7%9B%A4%E9%8B%BC%E7%AD%8B%E5%81%8F%E9%9B%A2%E5%9C%96%E5%89%87%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%A2%E6%8B%86%E5%8D%B8%E9%87%8D%E5%BB%BA%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF%E6%95%B4%E9%AB%94%E4%BE%9B%E6%87%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢有結構工程師認同做法</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200006-%E9%95%B7%E5%AF%A6%E5%AE%89%E9%81%94%E8%87%A3%E9%81%93%E9%A6%96%E7%BD%AE%E7%9B%A4%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%A2%E9%A0%88%E6%8B%86%E5%8D%B8%E9%87%8D%E5%BB%BA%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E5%95%86%E6%9B%B4%E6%AD%A3%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%8B%E6%96%B0%E6%89%BF%E5%BB%BA%E5%95%86%E5%90%8D%E7%A8%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢發展商更正接手新承建商名稱</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【女童拎兩大袋啤酒疑涉虐兒】</p><p>屯門一名小學生日前拿著兩大袋啤酒，其父母涉嫌虐兒被捕，獲准保釋。勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡指，社署評估後認為，該個家庭三名小孩不適宜即時回家，已為他們安排臨時住宿。女童母親接受媒體訪問稱，自己正戒酒，減至每日飲五罐，父親就聲稱當時是訓練大女的肌肉。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199595-%E5%A5%B3%E7%AB%A5%E6%8B%8E%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E7%96%91%E6%B6%89%E8%99%90%E5%85%92%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E8%81%B2%E7%A8%B1%E8%A8%93%E7%B7%B4%E5%A5%B3%E5%85%92%E8%82%8C%E8%82%89%E7%A4%BE%E7%BD%B2%E7%A4%BE%E5%B7%A5%E5%B7%B2%E8%81%AF%E7%B5%A1%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢事發片段</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200002-%E5%A5%B3%E7%AB%A5%E6%8B%8E%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E7%96%91%E6%B6%89%E8%99%90%E5%85%92%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E9%A0%98%E7%B6%9C%E6%8F%B4%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%96%E9%81%8A%E5%AD%AB%E7%8E%89%E8%8F%A1%E6%8C%87%E7%A4%BE%E7%BD%B2%E6%AD%A3%E6%AA%A2%E8%A6%96\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢涉事家庭領綜援仍有外遊</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200063-%E5%A5%B3%E7%AB%A5%E6%8B%8E%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E7%96%91%E6%B6%89%E8%99%90%E5%85%92%E6%9E%97%E6%AD%A3%E8%B2%A1%E7%B1%B2%E5%AE%B6%E9%95%B7%E7%94%A8%E5%90%88%E9%81%A9%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%A8%93%E7%B7%B4%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢林正財籲用合適方法訓練子女</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【中歐貿易磋商達成共識】</p><p>中歐結束貿易投資磋商例會，雙方達成16項共識，包括探討降低部分商品關稅的可能性。商務部長王文濤重申，中國是歐盟夥伴而不是問題根源。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200070-%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%90%E5%B0%B1%E6%B7%B7%E8%83%BD%E6%B1%BD%E8%BB%8A%E8%B2%BF%E6%98%93%E9%81%94%E6%88%90%E8%AB%92%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%B1%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%96%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E8%88%87%E6%AD%90%E7%9B%9F%E7%B6%93%E8%B2%BF%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢會議成果</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200109-%E7%8E%8B%E6%AF%85%E8%82%AF%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%90%E8%B2%BF%E6%98%93%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E7%A3%8B%E5%95%86%E6%A9%9F%E5%88%B6%E7%8D%B2%E7%A9%8D%E6%A5%B5%E6%88%90%E6%9E%9C%E6%87%89%E4%BF%83%E9%80%B2%E9%9B%99%E8%B4%8F%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E9%9B%99%E8%BC%B8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢王毅：應促進「雙贏」避免「雙輸」</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199322-%E6%AD%90%E7%9B%9F%E6%93%AC%E8%A8%AD%E6%96%B0%E8%B2%BF%E6%98%93%E6%88%B0%E5%8F%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%87%E9%87%9D%E5%B0%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E4%BF%83%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%B7%E5%8B%BF%E5%B0%87%E7%B6%93%E8%B2%BF%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%8C%96\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢中方促法德勿將經貿問題政治化</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【中方提名宋莉競選世衞總幹事】</p><p>中國證實提名資深公共衞生官員宋莉，競選下一任世界衞生組織總幹事。若當選，將成為繼陳馮富珍後，第二位執掌世衞的中國人。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199517-%E6%93%9A%E5%A0%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E6%93%AC%E6%8F%90%E5%90%8D%E5%AE%8B%E8%8E%89%E8%A7%92%E9%80%90%E4%B8%96%E8%A1%9E%E7%B8%BD%E5%B9%B9%E4%BA%8B%E8%8B%A5%E7%95%B6%E9%81%B8%E5%B0%87%E6%88%90%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%9F%B7%E6%8E%8C%E4%B8%96%E8%A1%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢分析指北京有機會擴大影響力</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199789-%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%8B%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%8C%87%E6%8F%90%E5%90%8D%E5%AE%8B%E8%8E%89%E8%A7%92%E9%80%90%E4%B8%96%E8%A1%9E%E7%B8%BD%E5%B9%B9%E4%BA%8B%E9%AB%94%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%85%E5%AE%9A%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%A4%9A%E9%82%8A%E4%B8%BB%E7%BE%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢大國外交｜北京：體現堅定支持多邊主義</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【外交部發言人直呼高市早苗姓名】</p><p>日本外務省表示，已就中國外交部發言人在記者會中，不加頭銜直呼日本首相高市早苗姓名一事，向中方提出交涉。在北京，外交部回應稱，中方已多次闡明對當前中日關係的立場。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199685-%E6%97%A5%E6%96%B9%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E7%9B%B4%E5%91%BC%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%B6%89%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%8C%87%E5%B7%B2%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%A1%E9%97%A1%E6%98%8E%E5%B0%8D%E7%95%B6%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%A0%B4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢日方向中方提出交涉</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199740-%E6%97%A5%E6%96%B9%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E7%9B%B4%E5%91%BC%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%B6%89%E7%A8%B1%E5%91%BC%E6%94%B9%E8%AE%8A%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E7%94%9A%E9%BA%BC%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢稱呼改變反映甚麼？｜延伸閱讀</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【緬北電詐紀錄片揭明家施暴證據】</p><p>公安部聯合央視推出打擊緬北電詐園區的紀錄片，揭露犯罪集團明家的施暴證據，亦有受害者講述被割腎的經歷。紀錄片又提到武裝人員用AK47步槍，射殺企圖逃走的中國公民，最終造成六人死亡。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199085-%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%89%E9%83%A8%E8%81%AF%E5%90%88%E5%A4%AE%E8%A6%96%E6%8E%A8%E7%B7%AC%E5%8C%97%E9%9B%BB%E8%A9%90%E8%A6%86%E6%BB%85%E7%B4%80%E5%AF%A6%E6%8A%AB%E9%9C%B2%E6%98%8E%E5%AE%B6%E9%9B%86%E5%9C%98%E4%BA%82%E6%A7%8D%E6%89%93%E6%AD%BB%E6%B4%BB%E4%BA%BA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢明家集團亂槍打死活人</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199268-%E5%A4%AE%E8%A6%96%E6%8F%AD%E7%B7%AC%E5%8C%97%E9%9B%BB%E9%A8%99%E5%9C%92%E5%8D%80%E6%AD%A6%E8%A3%9D%E4%BA%BA%E5%93%A1%E7%94%A8AK47%E6%AD%A5%E6%A7%8D%E5%B0%84%E6%AE%BA%E4%BC%81%E5%9C%96%E9%80%83%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%E8%87%B4%E5%85%AD%E6%AD%BB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢武裝人員掃射企圖逃走中國公民</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199527-%E5%A4%AE%E8%A6%96%E6%8A%AB%E9%9C%B2%E7%8E%8B%E6%98%9F%E9%81%AD%E6%8B%90%E8%B3%A3%E8%87%B3%E7%B7%AC%E7%94%B8%E8%A9%90%E9%A8%99%E5%9C%92%E5%8D%80%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A9%E8%A2%AB%E8%B3%A3%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%A3%E8%B2%A9%E8%B3%A3%E9%9B%86%E5%9C%98%E8%A6%81%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E9%8C%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢王星於緬甸四天被賣三次</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【俄鼠疫研究所疑洩危險病原】</p><p>俄羅斯一間鼠疫實驗室懷疑洩漏危險病原，一名研究員感染不明原因肺炎死亡，近200人接受觀察。據報俄羅斯再有實驗室人員感染不明肺炎病逝，世衞敦促俄方回應，俄方駁斥傳媒報道不正確，當局其後對伊爾庫茨克州解除防疫措施，指當地不明肺炎死亡個案不存在健康風險。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199060-%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%85%E6%96%AF%E9%BC%A0%E7%96%AB%E5%AF%A6%E9%A9%97%E5%AE%A4%E7%96%91%E6%B4%A9%E6%BC%8F%E5%8D%B1%E9%9A%AA%E7%97%85%E5%8E%9F%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0%E8%82%BA%E7%82%8E%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢</a><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199245-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E4%BF%84%E9%BC%A0%E7%96%AB%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%89%80%E7%96%91%E6%B4%A9%E6%BC%8F%E5%8D%B1%E9%9A%AA%E7%97%85%E5%8E%9F%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E7%A8%B1%E8%88%87%E4%BF%84%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%A8%E9%98%B2%E6%8E%A7%E9%A0%98%E5%9F%9F%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E5%AF%86%E5%88%87%E4%BA%A4%E6%B5%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">首宗死亡個案</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199417-%E4%B8%96%E8%A1%9B%E7%A8%B1%E5%B0%B1%E7%96%91%E4%BC%BC%E8%82%BA%E9%BC%A0%E7%96%AB%E7%97%85%E4%BE%8B%E8%88%87%E4%BF%84%E6%96%B9%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E8%81%AF%E7%B9%AB%E9%AD%AF%E6%AF%94%E5%A5%A7%E4%BF%83%E4%BF%84%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢特朗普稱安排與普京通電話</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199632-%E6%93%9A%E5%A0%B1%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%85%E6%96%AF%E5%86%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%AF%A6%E9%A9%97%E5%AE%A4%E4%BA%BA%E5%93%A1%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E8%82%BA%E7%82%8E%E7%97%85%E9%80%9D%E4%BF%84%E6%96%B9%E9%A7%81%E6%96%A5%E5%A0%B1%E9%81%93%E4%B8%8D%E6%AD%A3%E7%A2%BA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢據報再有俄實驗室人員染不明肺炎病逝</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199857-%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%85%E6%96%AF%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4%E9%98%B2%E7%96%AB%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E8%82%BA%E7%82%8E%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E5%80%8B%E6%A1%88%E7%84%A1%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%8D%E7%9B%B8%E4%BF%A1%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E8%AA%AA%E6%B3%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢俄羅斯解除防疫措施稱無風險</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199379-%E8%82%BA%E9%BC%A0%E7%96%AB%E5%8F%AF%E7%B6%93%E9%A3%9B%E6%B2%AB%E4%BA%BA%E5%82%B3%E4%BA%BA%E4%BF%84%E5%AF%A6%E9%A9%97%E5%AE%A4%E5%A5%B3%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E5%93%A1%E6%9F%93%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%8E%E8%82%BA%E7%82%8E%E4%BA%A1%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%98%BB%E6%96%B7%E5%82%B3%E6%92%AD%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢肺鼠疫可經飛沫人傳人｜如何阻斷傳播？</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【美國放寬對俄柴油制裁】</p><p>美國長期制裁俄羅斯之際，總統特朗普突然宣布與俄羅斯達成協議，俄羅斯將向美國及全球供應柴油，美國財政部其後宣布，放寬對俄柴油制裁。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200047-%E7%BE%8E%E4%BF%84%E9%81%94%E6%9F%B4%E6%B2%B9%E5%8D%94%E8%AD%B0%E8%A2%AB%E6%8C%87%E6%8C%BD%E6%95%91%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%BA%A6%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E6%96%99%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%87%83%E6%96%99%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%E5%83%85%E5%BE%AE%E8%B7%8C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢烏克蘭批向普京「送大禮」</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【沖繩美軍涉劫殺日本女子】</p><p>日本沖繩一名美軍，懷疑在酒店殺害一名當地女子被捕。日方向美方提出強烈抗議，要求全力配合調查，首相高市早苗表示，這宗罪行極其殘忍及令人髮指。美軍指會嚴守紀律，未有向日方道歉。駐沖繩美軍實施外出限制。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1198900-%E6%B2%96%E7%B9%A9%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E7%96%91%E5%8A%AB%E6%AE%BA%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%97%A5%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%B7%E7%83%88%E6%8A%97%E8%AD%B0%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%BE%8E%E6%96%B9%E5%85%A8%E5%8A%9B%E9%85%8D%E5%90%88%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢日方提強烈抗議</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199144-%E6%B2%96%E7%B9%A9%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E7%96%91%E5%8A%AB%E6%AE%BA%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%83%E5%9A%B4%E5%AE%88%E7%B4%80%E5%BE%8B%E6%9C%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%90%91%E6%97%A5%E6%96%B9%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢美軍未有道歉</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199418-%E6%B2%96%E7%B9%A9%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD%E5%A4%96%E5%87%BA%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E6%B2%96%E7%B9%A9%E7%B8%A3%E7%9F%A5%E4%BA%8B%E6%99%A4%E9%98%B2%E7%9B%B8%E6%8A%97%E8%AD%B0%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E6%B6%89%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢沖繩美軍實施外出限制</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199203-%E6%B2%96%E7%B9%A9%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E7%8A%AF%E6%A1%88%E7%BA%8D%E7%BA%8D%E6%97%A5%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E5%8D%94%E5%AE%9A%E8%B3%A6%E4%BA%88%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%96%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢沖繩美軍犯案纍纍　《日美地位協定》賦予法外地位？｜延伸閱讀</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199690-%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E9%80%9A%E8%AD%98%E6%97%A5%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%E5%8D%94%E5%AE%9A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢時事通識｜日美地位協定</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200119-%E6%96%B0%E8%8F%AF%E7%A4%BE%E6%B2%96%E7%B9%A9%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E6%B6%89%E5%8A%AB%E6%AE%BA%E6%A1%88%E5%87%B8%E9%A1%AF%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E4%BE%9D%E9%99%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E6%83%A1%E6%9E%9C%E6%93%9A%E5%A0%B1%E6%97%A5%E7%BE%8E%E6%BC%94%E7%BF%92%E6%9A%AB%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢新華社評論：劫殺案凸顯日本依附美國惡果</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【皮萊奪諾貝爾和平獎】</p><p>聯合國前人權事務高級專員、國際法院法官皮萊奪得諾貝爾和平獎。挪威諾貝爾委員會形容她有堅定的道德標準，頒獎給她是要凸顯尊重國際法的重要。皮萊說笑稱可能會與特朗普分享獎項。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199999-%E8%AB%BE%E8%B2%9D%E7%88%BE%E7%8D%8E%E5%92%8C%E5%B9%B3%E7%8D%8E%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%BB%E7%9A%AE%E8%90%8A%E7%AC%91%E7%A8%B1%E8%88%87%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB%E7%8D%8E%E9%A0%85%E6%8C%87%E5%8A%A0%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%87%A8%E7%A8%AE%E6%97%8F%E6%BB%85%E7%B5%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢皮萊指加沙面臨種族滅絕</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199648-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E9%87%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%87%89%E7%8D%B2%E9%A0%92%E8%AB%BE%E8%B2%9D%E7%88%BE%E5%92%8C%E5%B9%B3%E7%8D%8E%E5%9D%A6%E8%A8%80%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%8D%B2%E7%8D%8E%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%A7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢特朗普重申自己應得獎</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200024-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%99%A2%E9%95%B7%E7%A8%B1%E7%BA%8C%E7%82%BA%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E5%B0%8B%E6%B1%82%E5%85%AC%E7%BE%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢美國制裁國際刑事法院</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【歐洲多國爆發示威浪潮】</p><p>法國多個城市有示威，抗議政府在教育方面沒有投放足夠資源，連日示威造成逾6,500人被捕、近千人受傷。鄰國比利時亦有示威，不滿政府緊縮預算，期間爆發警民衝突。西班牙大批示威者抗議當局未有妥善應對房屋問題，首相桑切斯宣布提前大選，期望爭取民眾支持。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199414-%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%B0%E7%BA%8C%E6%9C%89%E7%A4%BA%E5%A8%81%E6%8A%97%E8%AD%B0%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E8%B3%87%E6%BA%90%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E9%80%A3%E6%97%A5%E7%A4%BA%E5%A8%81%E9%80%BE6500%E4%BA%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢法國民眾抗議教育資源不足</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199246-%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%A7%80%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E7%A4%BA%E5%A8%81%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%89%BD%E5%8B%95%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%BD%A2%E5%8B%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢世界觀｜法國示威如何牽動選舉形勢？</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199169-%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E5%8F%8A%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E6%9C%89%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%A8%81%E6%8A%97%E8%AD%B0%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E6%87%89%E5%B0%8D%E4%BD%8F%E5%B1%8B%E5%8F%8A%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%9B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢西班牙民眾抗議住屋問題</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199055-%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E9%A6%96%E7%9B%B8%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D11%E6%9C%8829%E6%97%A5%E8%88%89%E8%A1%8C%E8%AD%B0%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E6%8A%95%E7%A5%A8%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E9%9C%80%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E7%88%AD%E5%8F%96%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢西班牙提前舉行議會選舉投票</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199631-%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%9987%E6%AD%B2%E5%9B%A0%E7%A7%9F%E9%87%91%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87%E8%A2%AB%E8%BF%AB%E9%81%B7%E5%A9%86%E5%A9%86%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%96%E6%95%B8%E5%8D%83%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E6%82%BC%E5%BF%B5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢西班牙被迫遷婆婆去世　數千人悼念</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199487-%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%A7%80%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E7%A7%9F%E5%B1%8B%E9%9B%A3%E6%A1%91%E5%88%87%E6%96%AF%E9%99%B7%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%8D%B1%E6%A9%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢世界觀｜西班牙租屋難　桑切斯陷政治危機？</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199992-%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%89%E6%95%99%E5%B8%AB%E5%B7%A5%E6%9C%83%E6%93%AC%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%BA%8C%E5%85%A8%E5%9C%8B%E5%A4%A7%E7%BD%B7%E5%B7%A5%E6%AF%94%E5%88%A9%E6%99%82%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%A8%81%E4%B8%8D%E6%BB%BF%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E7%B7%8A%E7%B8%AE%E9%A0%90%E7%AE%97\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢比利時示威者不滿政府緊縮預算</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T21:17:58.465008+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2276,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}